 isn't a person but an object owned by the vampire who is responsible for its every action in the eyes of two terrible tyrannical group of monsters, Vampire Society and Seers of the Throne) and demanding the vampire to be punished as an object lesson. The ghoul is and will likely remain property, either of the vampire, another vampire, or a Seer and if not they are most likely dead which doesn't prevent petty Seers with Death from enjoying a new ghost servant.<br /> <br /> Funniest/Cruelest version? The Seer did see the lie, knows the truth the vampire is innocent, both black mails the ghoul to get a few favors and then demand punishment of the ghouls regent anyway, and asking for the ghoul as a slave as compensation treating then get the ghoul all 'Stockholmed' with alternating abuse and kindness into an obedient pet.<br /> <br /> The only funnier thing would the Ghoul then Awakening, and then being initiated as a Seer of the Throne, all in earnest because, that's the type of cut-throat power starved person the PC is at that point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 03-24-2018, 08:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T06:08:24-07:00","id":1199015,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1191027-advice-on-tasks-and-chores-for-a-pc-ghoul?p=1198988#post1198988\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"http://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/VideoGameCrueltyPotential\" target=\"_blank\">Wow! Stabbed a guy that he didn't really know too personally in the back at a nightclub for being a pompous and unlikable?</a> That PC is either a Psychopath or a Sociopath.</div> </div> </div> </div>Poseur did say it was a 'desperate move', that implies there's more to the situation than attacking on a whim.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":""